<title>HONG KONG: UBS sets warrants on Lai Sun Development.</title>
<headline>UBS sets warrants on Lai Sun Development.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Union Bank of Switzerland, Hong Kong Branch, said on Wednesday it has launched 165 million American style call warrants on shares of Lai Sun Development Co Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$11.685	PREMIUM	   19.64 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$0.3031	GEARING	   4.06x</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  22.APR.98	EXER LOT	  10,000</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG	SETTLEMENT DATE 24.FEB.97</p>
<p> REFERENCE SPOT    HK$12.30	 LISTING DATE    27.FEB.97</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
</text>
